ke anyone believe what they want to  believe especially if there's heaps of  cash involved he ends up poisoning pete  and gets away with it with others  believing this alcoholic just drank too  much this allows stanton to swipe his  book of tricks but on a more  subconscious level he's taking out  another drunk a drunk who harmed a woman  he loved xena tells stanton that pete  breaks her heart he's drinking too much  thus she suffers like stanton's mother  who also experienced firsthand the harm  of an alcoholic lover for this reason  stanton doesn't drink it's a point of  pride for him but by the end of the film  he'll become a full-blown alcoholic one  night the carnival's geek escapes back  in the 40s when this story takes place  carnival geek shows consisted of a  circular ring where a performer would  bite the head off of a live chicken and  swallow it these were mainly alcoholics  or drug addicts paid in liquor and  narcotics stanton ends up finding this  geek in the carnival's aptly named house  of damnation a house with mirrors that  are captioned take a look at yourself  sinner all of this foreshadows stanton's  continual descent into damnation himself  he ends up beating the geek close to  death which becomes hauntingly ironic  since that's who he'll become at the end  of the film a damned alcoholic beast of  a man who has to resort to biting the  heads off chickens to survive is he man  or beast at the same time stanton is  brought under the wing of ringmaster  clem clem tells him how he drugs drunks  in order to turn them into subservient  geeks the two of them will later have to  drop off their geek at a local hospital  where you can see the jesus saves neon  sign and i can't help but think that it  looks rather like save us but maybe  that's just me we also see his  collection of pickled fetuses of both  the human and animal variety a  particular note is this one which clem  states as a child whose head was so  large the mother died during birth  notice the protruding eye near the top  which conjures images of stanton's  blindfold while performing in the big  city during his time at the carnival  stanton falls in love with a carney  named molly her stage name is elektra  and she performs a routine where  currents of electricity pass through her  body to win her over he designs a new  routine where they'd fake her death  using an electrocution chair of his  design and they say chivalry is dead as  the two perfect the routine we see just  how good stanton is at reading others  when a local police officer threatens to  shut down the entire show stanton is  able to talk the sheriff into letting  them continue when he uses his excellent  powers of deduction to cold read that  the sheriff's mother had passed and that  she is talking to him from beyond we can  really see that stanton's character is a  liar and a damned good one at that so  when he leaves the carnival and promises  molly the world if she comes along with  him it doesn't take too long to realize  he's lying to her too two years pass and  stanton and molly have their own show in  the big city stanton has finally got  what he's wanted but for him it'll never  be enough he wants to take his show to  the next level and this involves doing  what xena and pete warned him never to  do he'll trick some of the city's  richest citizens into believing their  loved ones are talking to them from  beyond the grave in order to amass even  more wealth of course molly is against  this but like every warning stanton  receives he ignores this leads him to dr  lilith ritter a psychologist who attends  many of his shows believing he's a con  man the two eventually team up in a  rather ingenious plot dr ritter happens  to be a therapist to some of the richest  and most influential men in the city and  through her recorded sessions she has a  ton of personal information that stanton  can exploit for example he finds out  that mrs kimball the wife of a prominent  judge yearns to know more about the  death of their son who died in the  trenches during world war 1. knowing  this stanton tells her that her son  loves her that his death was quick and  that one day they'll be reunited but  things get dangerous when stanton is  asked to do a session with unhinged  businessman ezra grindel he's wanting to  be put in touch with a long lost love  and has been burned in the past by other  con men hence why he has stan connected  to a polygraph stanton beats the  polygraph and gains ezra's trust and you  might be asking herself how did he do it  how did he beat the polygraph the simple  answer is that stanton actually believes  in his own lies that's how far down the  rabbit hole he's gone earlier in the  film there's a scene between stanton and  pete in which pete uses the term shuddai  referring to when a man has lied so much  that he ends up believing his own lies  and when those lies end you see the face  of god and no one can outrun god but  stanton is full of hubris when zena  gives him a bad tarot reading he simply  turns one of the cards right side up  this is symbolized through the hangman  card which when facing upward represents  wisdom but upside down selfishness  pretty fitting for our main character  ezra wants something stanton has never  done before to make the dead materialize  before his very eyes and stanton always  dreaming of bigger ways to con those  around him creates a plan to have molly  dress up as ezra's long-lost love a  woman who died during a botched abortion  one which ezra made her get later in the  film he confides in stanton that he had  been violent to many women in the past  but claims this woman was the one he  truly loved dr lilith says she'll take  no part in this plan she has a great  line where she says if his foot slips  both of them fall even she sees that  he's in too deep but stanton creates a  fake key to later break in and steal dr  lillis information about ezra he will do  anything to get what he wants 